WEBVTT

NOTE
This FMV continues the Timber train mission, showing the second coupling phase and the car swap sequence. The mechanical arm locks onto the president's train car, connecting the two trains fully. The dummy car is swapped with the president's private car. The trains then decouple and diverge onto different tracks while speeding through the countryside at high velocity.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Close-up of the coupling mechanism locking into the president's train car. Metal connectors clamp down with mechanical force. The lock is secured with a heavy metallic sound.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The two trains are now fully connected. Steel couplings gleam in the daylight. The trains move as one unit across the countryside.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
The camera shows a longer view of the connected trains. The passenger car of the SeeD team is now directly coupled to the president's armored car. Both trains continue at high speed through green landscape.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Inside one of the train cars, the dummy presidential figure is being carefully swapped with the real president. Personnel move with precision as the operation unfolds. The camera captures the exchange from multiple angles.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
The dummy figure is positioned in the president's private car. Military personnel handle the transfer carefully. The operation is executed with tactical precision.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
The coupling system begins to reverse. Mechanical arms disengage from the connection point. The trains are preparing to separate.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
The two trains start to diverge onto separate tracks. The countryside blurs past at high speed. The tracks bend in different directions as the trains pull apart.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.000
The decoupling sequence nears completion. The mechanical arms withdraw completely. The two trains are now moving independently on parallel tracks.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The trains are fully separated. They move away from each other on diverging tracks. The lush green countryside stretches between them. The camera pulls back to show both trains becoming smaller as they continue in different directions. The successful mission unfolds across the landscape as the scene fades.
